      "text": "Contents\n1. Delivery Intent\n2. Product Scope\n3. Sprint Mechanics\n4. Release Learning Objectives",
      "headings": []
    },
    {
      "text": "1 Delivery Intent\n1.1 Evidence Inputs\nScrum teams align work to scrum product delivery goals and record evidence before advancing the work item.\n• Review the signal before changing the plan\n• Keep ownership visible across handoffs\nStage Evidence Owner\nFrame Baseline Lead\nTest Outcome Team\nLearn Decision Sponsor",
      "headings": [
        {
          "page": 3,
          "title": "Delivery Intent",
          "level": 1
